pqzl (Rust) — third-party notices

pqzl is a pure-Rust port of the PQZL C core of SCaaS pqz-core (../src, ../lazer). Its own code is under the repository
licence (../../../LICENSE, Vegan Community License 1.0). The C core retains and adapts LaZer, and this crate ports that
code (arithmetic, ABDLOP, quadratic proofs, lnp-tbox, the proof encoding) to Rust. A source or binary distribution of
this crate must carry this file and LICENSE-lazer.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LaZer — https://github.com/lazer-crypto/lazer, commit 3330e487228f633eceb322807b13a596b516770f
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Retained in pqz-core:
  - lazer/*: a subset of LaZer's src/ and its config.h. Files changed for pqz-core carry "PQZ:" comments; the
    unmodified copy is repository commit c91b3ab (abdlop.c and dom.h were added unmodified later).
  - params/codegen/codegen.sage, params/codegen/lnp-tbox-codegen.sage: LaZer's scripts/, modified.
  - params/pqz_*_params.h: generated by the LaZer code generator above.
  - src/pqz_rel.c: the proof encoding follows LaZer's lin-proofs.c (lnp_tbox_encproof / lnp_tbox_decproof).
  - src/pqz_sv.c: re-implements the verification of LaZer's lnp-tbox.c for the PQZ relations.
